OL,3,GNEWSAAI machine 'helps save 25 million
OL,4,ALego bricks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of projects Brad Hacking said
OL,7,Fautomating the process was essential
OL,8,Fbecause sorting large quantities of
OL,9,Fmixed Lego by hand was "really
OL,10,Fdifficult".
